      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around SIM Card in Dessert line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Я никому не нужен.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not needed by anyone.' Lyova complains about feeling useless. He dramatically claims nobody needs him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Люба, клиент нашел сим-карту в десерте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lyuba, a customer found a SIM card in the dessert.' Kostya interrupts with an urgent problem. He reports a customer found a SIM card in their food.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Сим-карту? В десерте?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A SIM card? In the dessert?' Lyova is shocked by the news. He repeats the words in disbelief.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Да, он требует шеф-повара.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, he demands the chef.' Kostya confirms the serious situation. He adds that the angry customer is demanding to see the chef.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Иди к нему, Лёва.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go to him, Lyova.' He tells Lyova to handle it. Kostya urges him to go speak with the customer.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Я не пойду туда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will not go there.' Lyova flatly refuses to face the angry guest. He says he will not go out there.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Что значит, ты не пойдешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean, you will not go?' Kostya is confused by his refusal. He asks Lyova what he means by that.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ты сегодня шеф-повар.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are the chef today.' Kostya reminds Lyova of his temporary promotion. He points out that Lyova is the chef today.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Иди и разбирайся с этим.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go and figure this out.' He orders Lyova to take charge. Kostya tells him to go and figure this mess out.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Но я не шеф-повар.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But I am not the chef.' Lyova tries to back out of his role. He insists he is not the real head chef.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Лёва, тебе надо разобраться.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lyova, you need to figure it out.' Kostya emphasizes the necessity of action. He tells Lyova he has to deal with it regardless.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Я боюсь туда идти.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am afraid to go there.' Lyova admits his true feelings. He confesses he is too afraid to go out there.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Давай, иди.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, go.' Kostya tries to push him into action. He impatiently tells him to just go. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
